                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0710fbd2-8841-407f-8435-b595b2fa026e",
                                "sense_id": "02093afa-9f8a-33f4-8c8e-e70da5054dcd",
                                "text": "In the world of hip hop, many freestyle artists have been known to speak, “Check one, check two!” into the microphone. The phrasing serves two purposes: (1) to put the freestyle artist on rhythm with the beat and (2) […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e15e3b90-1960-39f9-93bd-46490cbd2d6a",
                        "entry_id": "5f80985e-ff25-3a97-abf5-093c230d07e7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Anything done in an improvised or unrestricted way."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "attributive",
                            "broadly",
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd3a06d4-9364-41ef-ae1f-ed1b52031322",
                                "sense_id": "e15e3b90-1960-39f9-93bd-46490cbd2d6a",
                                "text": "(While there are definitely a large number of Japanese cookbooks out there with detailed instructions and measurements, it was this freestyle cooking philosophy I most frequently encountered.)"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "836ea58d-31a8-3d4b-8388-1a47e1fd9858",
                        "entry_id": "5f80985e-ff25-3a97-abf5-093c230d07e7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ellipsis of Latin freestyle, a form of electronic dance music."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "countable",
                            "ellipsis",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a3ec2dc6-b636-45fe-9808-b6ece9a2fb19",
                                "sense_id": "836ea58d-31a8-3d4b-8388-1a47e1fd9858",
                                "text": "A not always visibly but nevertheless significantly Latin music, freestyle originated alongside hip-hop in the Bronx and achieved a quicker yet more fleeting commercial success. The style’s similarities to contemporaneous R&B and hi-NRG endeared it to pop radio programmers, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e754230c-2c4c-4a61-94e9-e9ac415dcd94",
                                "sense_id": "836ea58d-31a8-3d4b-8388-1a47e1fd9858",
                                "text": "Already a veteran DJ-producer on New York’s freestyle scene, 23-year-old Frankie Bones was flown to England for an Energy rave."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
